<title>AUSTRALIA: Anaconda Nickel shares suspended on ASX.</title>
<headline>Anaconda Nickel shares suspended on ASX.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Stock Exchange said on Thursday that the securities of Anaconda Nickel NL had been suspended pending an announcement.  </p>
<p>The exchange did not provide further details.</p>
<p>Anaconda is developing the A$900 million Murrin Murrin nickel and cobalt project in Western Australia.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsrom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
